    "title": "Basketball Recap: Bear Grass Charter Comes Up Short + How To Watch - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Team Reports ,\n22 hours ago After flying high against East Carteret on Monday, Bear Grass Charter came back down to earth. The Bears came up short against the Pamlico County Hurricanes on Tuesday, falling 66-43. The Bears were given a dose of their own medicine in this game as the Hurricanes apparently hadn't forgotten their loss the last time these teams played back in December of 2024. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
